---
import { ArrowRight, Award, Brain } from "lucide-astro";
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 lg:py-24 w-full flex justify-center">
  <div class="w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
    <div class="w-full lg:w-[40%] flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative">
      <div class="absolute w-64 h-64 bg-[#DA2984]/20 blur-[60px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="relative w-60 h-60 md:w-64 md:h-64 rounded-full shadow-2xl shadow-purple-950/40 group overflow-hidden">
        <img 
          src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dlppldpo1/image/upload/v1777564118/toki-photo_t8kcui.jpg" 
          alt="Rodrigo Torrico" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="absolute -top-4 right-4 bg-[#1c1538]/90 border border-white/10 px-3.5 py-1.8 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-lg backdrop-blur-xs select-none animate-float">
        <Award size={14} class="text-[#DA2984]" />
        <span class="text-white/80 text-[10px] font-bold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">7+ Anos Exp</span>
      </div>

      <div class="absolute -bottom-4 left-4 bg-[#1c1538]/90 border border-white/10 px-3.5 py-1.8 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-lg backdrop-blur-xs select-none animate-float-delayed">
        <Brain size={14} class="text-[#A406E9]" />
        <span class="text-white/80 text-[10px] font-bold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">AI-First Flow</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full lg:w-[60%] flex flex-col items-start text-left space-y-5">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <p class="font-mono font-medium text-xs tracking-[0.6px] bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-[#DA2984] to-[#A406E9] uppercase">
          08 — SOBRE MI
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white leading-tight tracking-tight">
          Rodrigo Torrico
          <span class="block text-base md:text-lg font-mono font-medium text-[#a0a0b4] mt-1">
            Senior Full Stack Engineer & Tech Mentor
          </span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-[#a0a0b4] text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">
        <p>
          Como Senior Full Stack Engineer con mas de 7 anos de experiencia construyendo productos escalables, he liderado sistemas para <strong class="text-white font-semibold">6M de usuarios</strong> en Unosquare y optimizado pipelines de entrega en tiempo record en AWS.
        </p>
        <p>
          Especializado en <strong class="text-white font-semibold">Node.js, TypeScript, Angular, React y Go</strong>, me enfoco en transformar ideas complejas en software real y robusto, integrando herramientas de IA para maximizar la velocidad y calidad en cada etapa.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a 
        href="https://tokidev.ai" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer" 
        class="w-full sm:w-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] duration-300 cursor-pointer shadow-md"
      >
        Conocer mas sobre mi trabajo
        <ArrowRight size={14} class="text-[#DA2984]" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
    }
  }

  .animate-float {
    animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .animate-float-delayed {
    animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    animation-delay: 2s;
  }
</style>
